{"suttaId":"thag10.2","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2281,2311],"vripara":"537"},"segments":{"thag10.2:0.4":"Ekavihāriyattheragāthā","thag10.2:1.1":"“Purato pacchato vāpi, aparo ce na vijjati;","thag10.2:1.3":"Atīva phāsu bhavati, ekassa vasato vane.","thag10.2:2.1":"“Handa eko gamissāmi, araññaṃ buddhavaṇṇitaṃ;","thag10.2:2.3":"Phāsu [phāsuṃ (syā. pī.)] ekavihārissa, pahitattassa bhikkhuno.","thag10.2:3.1":"“Yogī-pītikaraṃ rammaṃ, mattakuñjarasevitaṃ;","thag10.2:3.3":"Eko attavasī khippaṃ, pavisissāmi kānanaṃ.","thag10.2:4.1":"“Supupphite sītavane, sītale girikandare;","thag10.2:4.3":"Gattāni parisiñcitvā, caṅkamissāmi ekako.","thag10.2:5.1":"“Ekākiyo adutiyo, ramaṇīye mahāvane;","thag10.2:5.3":"Kadāhaṃ viharissāmi, katakicco anāsavo.","thag10.2:6.1":"“Evaṃ me kattukāmassa, adhippāyo samijjhatu;","thag10.2:6.3":"Sādhiyissāmahaṃyeva, nāñño aññassa kārako.","thag10.2:7.1":"“Esa bandhāmi sannāhaṃ, pavisissāmi kānanaṃ;","thag10.2:7.3":"Na tato nikkhamissāmi, appatto āsavakkhayaṃ.","thag10.2:8.1":"“Mālute upavāyante, sīte surabhigandhike [gandhake (syā. pī. ka.)];","thag10.2:8.3":"Avijjaṃ dālayissāmi, nisinno nagamuddhani.","thag10.2:9.1":"“Vane kusumasañchanne, pabbhāre nūna sītale;","thag10.2:9.3":"Vimuttisukhena sukhito, ramissāmi giribbaje.","thag10.2:10.1":"“Sohaṃ paripuṇṇasaṅkappo, cando pannaraso yathā;","thag10.2:10.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇo, natthi dāni punabbhavo”ti.","thag10.2:10.5":"… Ekavihāriyo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
